[length:03:48]
[ti:I Knew the Fire]
[ar:Aracnephobia]
[al:Chaotic-Dysfunctional]
[au:Aracne]
[lr:Aracne]
[by:Aracne]
[re:LRC Workbench by Azaria (lrc-workbench.azariadev.dev)]
[ve:0.3.3]
[00:12.40]I saw the smoke
[00:15.82]Before the flame
[00:18.12]I stayed anyway
[00:24.62]They call it weakness
[00:27.34]To feel this deep
[00:29.97]They call it reckless
[00:33.06]To never sleep
[00:35.73]I learned the cost
[00:37.61]I read the signs
[00:38.98]I didn’t fall
[00:40.60]I crossed the line
[00:42.08]Don’t tell me I didn’t know
[00:44.51]Don’t tell me I was blind
[00:49.04]I saw the ending coming
[00:51.53]And still called it mine
[00:59.31]I knew the fire
[01:02.22]I chose the burn
[01:05.06]I knew the lesson
[01:07.47]I refused to learn
[01:10.53]If loving you breaks the sky
[01:13.79]Then let it fall on me
[01:16.66]I don’t need saving
[01:19.21]I need to be free
[01:22.70]They love the glow
[01:25.66]They fear the heat
[01:28.73]They want the beauty
[01:31.61]Without the teeth
[01:33.72]I never asked
[01:36.37]To come out clean
[01:39.53]I wanted truth
[01:41.85]Not something safe
[01:46.16]I don’t mistake pain for love
[01:49.24]I know the difference well
[01:52.11]But some truths
[01:53.75]Only live in hell
[01:57.81]I knew the fire
[02:00.76]I chose the flame
[02:03.92]I knew the ruin
[02:06.62]I said your name
[02:08.51]If this is how the world ends
[02:11.22]I’ll stand right here
[02:14.28]I don’t regret
[02:17.01]What cost me everything
[02:43.70]Don’t call me broken
[02:46.53]I’m awake
[02:48.03]Don’t call me lost
[02:49.31]This was my way
[02:50.87]I don’t survive
[02:52.31]By staying whole
[02:53.78]I survive
[02:55.18]By choosing my own role
[02:59.70]I knew the fire
[03:02.30]I chose to stay
[03:05.40]I knew the dark
[03:08.04]I didn’t pray
[03:10.13]If loving you is my last sin
[03:12.93]Then let it be
[03:16.48]I don’t want heaven
[03:19.71]I want honesty
[03:35.59]I knew.
[03:40.25]And I stayed.
